        "body": "# IR-042: Delayed Document Processing"
      },
      {
        "id": "technical_summary",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## Technical Summary\n\n\n- **A configuration rollout exhausted the document worker connection pool for 47 minutes.** Requests queued rather than being rejected, but 1,840 documents exceeded the ten-minute processing objective.\n- **The trigger and recovery are understood.** A new retry interval increased simultaneous reconnect attempts; restoring the prior setting and recycling workers cleared the backlog.\n- **No document payloads were lost.** Four follow-up actions address rollout validation, pool telemetry, retry jitter, and backlog replay testing.",
